539,1.4],[29,540,2.8],[-24,465,1.4],[-25,464,2.8],[-16,465,1.4],[-17,464,2.8]]}],"npcs":[{"id":"castle_chest","name":"Castle chest","look":"chest","x":-10,"y":486,"chest":true,"examine":"The castle chest. Everything you own from Ashvale is kept in your arcade wallet; this is where you see it."},{"id":"castle_cook","name":"Marta the cook","look":"marta","x":41,"y":489,"shop":"castle_kitchen","examine":"Marta, who has cooked for the castle since before the castellan had his keys."},{"id":"castle_qm","name":"Quartermaster Hale","look":"hale","x":24,"y":471,"shop":"castle_general","examine":"Quartermaster Hale. Rope, nets, tinderboxes, bread: if the castle needs it, he counts it."},{"id":"castle_armourer","name":"Armourer Voss","look":"voss","x":20,"y":493,"shop":"castle_armoury","examine":"Armourer Voss, who keeps the watch in bowstrings and the gate guard in rivets."},{"id":"castellan","name":"Castellan Brannoc","look":"brannoc","guard":true,"talk":"quest","quest":"castellans_bridge","quests":["castellans_bridge"],"maxHit":10,"gear":{"weapon":"longsword_t2"},"x":5,"y":512,"examine":"Castellan Brannoc, keeper of the lake castle. He has the keys, and he has had them for a long time.","lines":["The lake keeps our back and the river keeps the road. The walls only have to argue with the bridge.","Walk the walls if you like; the steps are by the corners and either side of the gate."]},{"id":"gate_guard","name":"Gate guard","look":"ash_knight","guard":true,"maxHit":8,"gear":{"weapon":"sword_t3","shield":"shield_t2","head":"helmet_t2"},"x":-20,"y":462,"examine":"A guard at the castle gate, leaning on a spear he has not needed in years.","lines":["Welcome to the lake castle. Ashvale is back down the road, over the river bridge, south-west.","Mind the gatehouse, the portcullis sticks."]},{"id":"aldith","name":"Sister Aldith","look":"aldith","x":3,"y":470,"talk":"quest","quest":"vespers","quests":["vespers"],"examine":"Sister Aldith, chaplain of the Lake Castle, who rang the bell on her first evening and has not let it rest since."},{"id":"cressa","name":"Cressa the trader","look":"cressa","x":-11,"y":478,"examine":"Cressa, who sells whatever came over the bridge this week, and swears it was always meant to.","lines":["Market day is every day the road is open. Lately that is most days.","If you are going to the farm, Tobin owes me for a bell. Do not mention it. I will know if you did not."]},{"id":"edda","name":"Miller Edda","look":"edda","x":-54,"y":469,"talk":"quest","quest":"rats_in_the_grain","quests":["rats_in_the_grain"],"examine":"Miller Edda, floured to the elbows, who can tell the weather by the sails and the castle's mood by its bread."},{"id":"tobin","name":"Farmer Tobin","look":"tobin","x":45,"y":518,"talk":"quest","quest":"the_far_field","quests":["the_far_field"],"examine":"Farmer Tobin, who keeps the castle in mutton, milk and complaints about fences."},{"id":"watch_w1","name":"Watchman","look":"ash_knight","guard":true,"maxHit":6,"x":-38,"y":466,"patrol":[[-38,466],[-39,466],[-40,466],[-40,465],[-40,464],[-40,463],[-40,462],[-39,462],[-38,462],[-37,462],[-36,462],[-36,463],[-35,463],[-35,464],[-34,464]],"gear":{"weapon":"bow_t2","ammo":"arrows_t1","head":"helmet_t2"},"examine":"A watchman on the castle wall, bow strung, walking his round and looking out over the water.","lines":["Nothing on the lake today. There never is. That is the job.","If you came over the water, I would have seen you an hour ago."]},{"id":"watch_w2","name":"Watchman","look":"ash_knight","guard":true,"maxHit":6,"x":52,"y":466,"patrol":[[52,466],[53,466],[54,466],[54,465],[54,464],[54,463],[54,462],[53,462],[52,462],[51,462],[50,462],[50,463],[49,463],[49,464],[48,464]],"gear":{"weapon":"bow_t2","ammo":"arrows_t1","head":"helmet_t2"},"examine":"A watchman on the castle wall, bow strung, walking his round and looking out over the water.","lines":["Nothing on the lake today. There never is. That is the job.","If you came over the water, I would have seen 